        {
            "id": "0eaddfa3-44e6-4ff1-b494-0b67d941d527",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3016",
            "content": {
                "en": "Wait, do we know each other?",
                "zh": "等等，我们认识吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1372.7999267578125,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5bacf878-d59d-4e12-a981-b096b123f7cb",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3017",
            "content": {
                "en": "No time, listen to me!",
                "zh": "没时间了，你听我说！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1718.39990234375,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "6bf831ed-50c0-4cac-91e4-412b08b248a6",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3018",
            "content": {
                "en": "Huh? What happened?",
                "zh": "啊？发生什么事了？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2062.39990234375,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7ca18761-581b-4d94-9531-283365a5a60b",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "7dce9553-65bb-400b-9970-de7217fdd43d",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3019",
            "content": {
                "en": "Veris quickly tells Page what happened in the previous loop.",
                "zh": "何以真快速将上个循环发生的事告诉了周书。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2404.0,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b5b38991-a62a-4da3-bc36-123d8871599b",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3020",
            "content": {
                "en": "A loop? That’s impossible...",
                "zh": "循环?这怎么可能......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2751.199951171875,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f17b9deb-a35c-4e82-8c71-e505968ecf4f",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3021",
            "content": {
                "en": "At the end of the last loop, I saw the mirror in your hand glowing, and then you disappeared.",
                "zh": "我在上个循环的最后看到你手里的镜子发出了光，然后你整个人消失了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3089.599853515625,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d397c87a-40c8-4614-8f83-bba412c9269a",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3022",
            "content": {
                "en": "What! That’s the treasure my master specifically sent me to retrieve—there’s no way an outsider would know...",
                "zh": "什么！那可是师父特意派我去取的宝贝，外人不可能知道......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3429.599853515625,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "271e9d78-579c-48b6-a2f0-9676ead162d1",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "481038d5-cf0b-4d90-b374-cf1fd0c406cd",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3023",
            "content": {
                "en": "Damn it, my head’s spinning. Fine, I believe you.",
                "zh": "该死，我脑子不够用了，好吧，我信你说的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3761.599853515625,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "63f44891-45d4-4b8d-9ad4-00d5219b8c1a",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3024",
            "content": {
                "en": "Relax, give me your hand.",
                "zh": "你放松一点，把手给我。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4101.60009765625,
            "positionY": 720.7999877929688,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5eafd5be-c9f4-4944-9064-335dbeb78f19",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3025",
            "content": {
                "en": "That bronze mirror! So you really did leave before.",
                "zh": "那个铜镜！你之前果然是离开了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4446.400390625,
            "positionY": 720.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8704e1a4-d897-4182-9ef7-ff953f5be08c",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3026",
            "content": {
                "en": "I have no idea what you're talking about.",
                "zh": "我完全搞不懂你在说什么。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4788.0,
            "positionY": 717.5999755859375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
